    "summary": "web: second slop web on an occupied port silently double-binds on Linux (SO_REUSEPORT)",
    "details_md": "Reproduced live: second instance on the same port printed serving and requests round-robin between instances; the EADDRINUSE handler (server.ts:128) never fires on Linux because Bun sets SO_REUSEPORT. Pass reusePort:false explicitly or probe the port first.",
